    {
      "id": "hamstrings/assisted-prone-hamstring",
      "slug": "assisted-prone-hamstring",
      "name": "俯卧辅助腘绳肌",
      "muscle": "hamstrings",
      "bodyPart": "legs",
      "equipment": "bodyweight",
      "category": "strength",
      "secondaryMuscles": [],
      "instructions": [
        "以正确的身体排列就位——耳朵在肩膀上方，肩膀在髋部上方。",
        "仰卧，背部平贴在表面上，核心收紧。",
        "在开始动作前激活腘绳肌。感受意念-肌肉连接。",
        "以完全控制执行动作，掌控向心和离心两个阶段。",
        "控制下降回到起始位置——离心阶段和向心阶段一样能增长肌肉。",
        "呼吸：发力时呼气，回程时吸气。进行大重量复合动作时，深吸一口气到腹部，在最难的部分保持住。"
      ],
      "file": "hamstrings/assisted-prone-hamstring.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/assisted-prone-hamstring.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/assisted-prone-hamstring.thumb.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "hamstrings/barbell-good-morning",
      "slug": "barbell-good-morning",
      "name": "杠铃早安式体前屈",
      "muscle": "hamstrings",
      "bodyPart": "legs",
      "equipment": "barbell",
      "category": "strength",
      "secondaryMuscles": [
        "glutes",
        "calves"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "给杠铃装上合适的重量。双手紧握杠铃，双脚与肩同宽站立。",
        "膝盖微曲，从髋部折叠将臀部向后推——想象用臀部关上车门。",
        "下降直到感受到腘绳肌的深度拉伸，保持背部平直。一根扫帚放在脊柱上应该接触头部、中背和尾骨。",
        "将髋部向前推动站起来，在顶部用力收紧臀肌。",
        "呼吸：发力时呼气，回程时吸气。进行大重量复合动作时，深吸一口气到腹部，在最难的部分保持住。"
      ],
      "file": "hamstrings/barbell-good-morning.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/barbell-good-morning.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/barbell-good-morning.thumb.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "hamstrings/barbell-straight-leg-deadlift",
      "slug": "barbell-straight-leg-deadlift",
      "name": "杠铃直腿硬拉",
      "muscle": "hamstrings",
      "bodyPart": "legs",
      "equipment": "barbell",
      "category": "strength",
      "secondaryMuscles": [
        "glutes",
        "lats",
        "traps",
        "forearms",
        "spine"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "给杠铃装上合适的重量。双手紧握杠铃，双脚与肩同宽站立。",
        "双脚与髋同宽站立，杠铃在脚掌中间上方。屈髋，抬胸，夹紧腋窝以激活背阔肌。",
        "用腿将地面推开——髋部和肩膀像电梯一样同时上升。让杠铃沿腿部上移，就像在刮腿毛。",
        "在顶部完全站直，收紧臀肌像夹住一枚硬币。通过向后屈髋反向动作，让杠铃沿大腿滑下——它永远不离开身体。",
        "呼吸：发力时呼气，回程时吸气。进行大重量复合动作时，深吸一口气到腹部，在最难的部分保持住。"
      ],
      "file": "hamstrings/barbell-straight-leg-deadlift.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/barbell-straight-leg-deadlift.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/barbell-straight-leg-deadlift.thumb.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "hamstrings/cable-assisted-inverse-leg-curl",
      "slug": "cable-assisted-inverse-leg-curl",
      "name": "绳索辅助腿弯举反",
      "muscle": "hamstrings",
      "bodyPart": "legs",
      "equipment": "cable",
      "category": "strength",
      "secondaryMuscles": [
        "glutes",
        "calves"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "安装合适的把手，调整滑轮高度，选择工作重量。",
        "将肘部钉在体侧——想象它们被钉住了。只有前臂在动。",
        "用力收紧二头肌将重量弯举上来。在顶部，像挤橙汁一样挤压后再下放。",
        "缓慢用3秒下放，在每一厘米对抗重力。手腕保持像钢棒一样笔直。如果身体摇晃，重量太大了。",
        "呼吸：发力时呼气，回程时吸气。进行大重量复合动作时，深吸一口气到腹部，在最难的部分保持住。"
      ],
      "file": "hamstrings/cable-assisted-inverse-leg-curl.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/cable-assisted-inverse-leg-curl.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/cable-assisted-inverse-leg-curl.thumb.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "hamstrings/dumbbell-lying-femoral",
      "slug": "dumbbell-lying-femoral",
      "name": "哑铃仰卧股",
      "muscle": "hamstrings",
      "bodyPart": "legs",
      "equipment": "dumbbell",
      "category": "strength",
      "secondaryMuscles": [],
      "instructions": [
        "选择合适重量的哑铃。紧握哑铃，以稳定的姿势站好。",
        "仰卧，背部平贴在表面上，核心收紧。",
        "调整机器垫板使其位于脚跟正上方。紧握把手，髋部紧压垫板。",
        "将脚跟弯向臀部，在最大收缩时用力收紧腘绳肌。",
        "缓慢下放——在每一厘米对抗机器的拉力。不要让它落下。保持髋部下压以避免下背代偿。",
        "呼吸：发力时呼气，回程时吸气。进行大重量复合动作时，深吸一口气到腹部，在最难的部分保持住。"
      ],
      "file": "hamstrings/dumbbell-lying-femoral.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/dumbbell-lying-femoral.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/dumbbell-lying-femoral.thumb.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "hamstrings/exercise-ball-seated-hamstring-stretch",
      "slug": "exercise-ball-seated-hamstring-stretch",
      "name": "瑜伽球坐姿拉伸腘绳肌",
      "muscle": "hamstrings",
      "bodyPart": "legs",
      "equipment": "bodyweight",
      "category": "stretching",
      "secondaryMuscles": [],
      "instructions": [
        "以正确的身体排列就位——耳朵在肩膀上方，肩膀在髋部上方。",
        "挺直坐好，背部挺直，双脚平放在地面。",
        "缓慢移动到拉伸位置，直到感受到目标区域的轻柔拉力——不是疼痛。",
        "保持20到40秒，深呼吸。每次呼气时，尝试更深地沉入拉伸。",
        "缓慢释放，如需要可重复。坚持比强度更重要——定期拉伸获得持久柔韧性。",
        "在整个保持阶段深呼吸，保持均匀。拉伸时绝不要憋气。"
      ],
      "file": "hamstrings/exercise-ball-seated-hamstring-stretch.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/exercise-ball-seated-hamstring-stretch.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/hamstrings/exercise-ball-seated-hamstring-stretch.thumb.webp"
    },
